    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli ghoaghaawa Yordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sakteayda gabay ghang'eat Yoshuwa ak ghabeawa Shitimu, sea fuga sean bea Israeli; ak geahita Yordani, ak geenyo eepiida hoowa heeda mii ghoaghaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata eawooji samwagu ghang'ata fuga hees gwasik bugusta museasooda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwarukusa buuneeda nea geeyeesha, “Inyas ghoadaayi sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA nea ghwasar ashoohoodiga fuga Lawi abeeda ghoang'ami heedoondi ak ghoayaachi geeshta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajanala naweeda jea asiga, aba gideaba naweani ghayi mii asiga. Nea gagasa gwanda dageascheeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda ea agooga dageascheeda gaygooyang'da geatin sagalamnyooji iyeenya adiidu gooneekiisi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Oamiini geat; aba gideaba numuji NG'UTAMIIDA gaygwasin ng'asheega deamdeameadi aba jeedeang'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha ashoohoodiga, “Asareana sandakwajeanda neajeeda, ak goosiikchi madeeda buuneeda.” Ng'ata gageanda sandakwajeanda neajeeda, ak geeweay madeeda buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Yoshuwa, “Eanean gaydeambiinyi aba madeeda fuga sean bea Israeli, ak abeeda ghwanal gideaba gidaghayi eandeayeati Musa, gichea dandeayeataneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak girukusi ashoohoodiga sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda gideaba, ‘inyas ghoahiti ghuuta beega Yordani, abeeda ghoamiinaadi aba jeeda Yordani.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa fuga Israeli, “Apkaana hiji, ayiinya ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa, “Biisa gajanala gideaba ASEETA mideawa Eaweega gwanda jeedeang'wa, ak ea mayghwaraay ghahoan aba madeedeang'wa fuga Ganaani, ea Hiti, ea Hafiti, ea Berisi ea Girgashi, ea Amori, ea Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA gayghang'ataawa madeadaang'u buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida ea ghwahita Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa geani headi damaniyeenya bea Israeli gaygaba nih igeani ng'eedeanagi jeeda giliwas eamwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ghoala ashoohoodiga sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, Ng'utamiida bea ng'eanyiisean, ak ghoala beega Yordani, abeeda gayghamiinaada beega Yordani maygagulda, nea beega rarang'aan leabu humng'eeda gaygabassa geat hijagi gawuurji dulgwajeanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwariteawa buuneeda jeesinga maheemajeega nyaawa, ak ghoaghaawa Yordani, nea ghwasar ashoohoodiga sandakwajeanda neajeeda aba madeeda buuneeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea ghwahita fugiga sar sandakwajeandean Yordani, ak ghoala geeshanga ashoohoodiga sar sandakwajeanda beega sileeha (Yordani inyeesa ghwanyiit ea ghwanaawa mareedakaaschi aba damanda lajita booga), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak beegiga rarang'aana heetiyeadean, hean ghamiinaada ak ghang'eat gawuurji dulgwajeanda nea sheagi, aba Adamu, was mujiineedida neekeewa Saretani, ak beegiga gwararang'eesa basooda Araba was basooda balang'da, ak ghwajaam sean; ak googeawsa buuneeda meatkweeda deaschi Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasik fuga Israeli sean ng'eanyiida ghajaam, nea ashoohoodiga sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA ghamiinaada aba heeda ghajaam aba bugusta Yordani, ea gwayi bwak ea ghang'ata eemeesean aba Yordani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
